WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
Crazy Eights: emptying your hand scores 0 for a
hand. Play three; the lowest total wins.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:16.999 line:0
North plays ♠K; West follows with the ♠10.
Match the suit or the rank.

00:00:16.999 --> 00:00:24.999 line:0
Fast-forward: with no play, draw one card.
Q skips, A reverses, 2 makes the next player draw 2.

00:00:24.999 --> 00:00:34.999 line:0
West plays ♦8 and names spades next.
An 8 is wild and can always be played.

00:00:34.999 --> 00:00:44.000 line:0
Fast-forward through hand one: North goes out for 0;
leftovers score penalties, 50 for each 8.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:57.999 line:0
Fast-forward: hands two and three are dealt fresh;
penalties add up across the hands.

00:00:57.999 --> 00:01:07.000 line:0
North wins with the lowest total, 13;
South, West and East have 36, 39 and 76.
